# This directory's pins are byte pins. `sha256.txt` hashes three files exactly as
# they sit on disk, and `dev/bench/multiturn/live-gate.test.mjs` recomputes those
# hashes, so a checkout that turned LF into CRLF would fail that gate and leave
# `manifest.json` dirty forever.
#
# The repo is authored on Windows with `core.autocrlf=true`, which is exactly the
# setting that rewrites an unattributed file on checkout. This rule is therefore
# load-bearing, not tidiness. The two sibling fixture directories carry the same
# rule for the same reason.
#
# No `-diff`: a mutated transcript must stay reviewable as text.
* text eol=lf
